WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:01.740
- (laughing) You're always on the go.

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:03.370
So, are you one of those people

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:05.310
that you don't have to sleep much?

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.380
- Naw, I'm about four hours, five hours.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:08.215
- [Kelly] What?

00:00:08.215 --> 00:00:09.180
- Yeah.
(audience exclaiming)

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:10.013
- Oh my god.

00:00:10.013 --> 00:00:11.536
I'm a demon if I don't get eight.

00:00:11.536 --> 00:00:12.750
(audience laughing)
(50 Cent laughing)

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.070
I can survive on like six, seven,

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:17.470
but eight is a solid.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:18.810
- I tried.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:19.643
I'm up.

00:00:19.643 --> 00:00:21.700
So I started to do a little meditation.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:22.780
Do a little meditation, so I-

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:23.613
- I wish I could that.

00:00:23.613 --> 00:00:25.960
- I get my mantra from Deepak Chopra.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:26.793
- [Kelly] Wow!

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.119
- I'm not good at it.

00:00:29.119 --> 00:00:30.060
(audience laughing)
- [Kelly] I'm not either.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:30.900
- But I try it.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:31.850
- They tell you to not think of things,

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.010
and all I think about not thinking.

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:35.540
- It's hard not to think.
- Yeah.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.130
- Yo, I'm saying (reciting mantra),

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:38.360
saying the mantra.

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:39.983
Then, I'm all the way over there.

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:43.520
I gotta figure out how to do this.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:44.410
And then I'm right here,

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.290
and them I'm somewhere else in thought.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:47.340
You're supposed to not think.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:48.173
You're supposed to relax

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:50.510
and just calm yourself down but-

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:52.060
- [Kelly] I can't do it either.

